From a5bffda990047cb58db4b1b5311ff3fcff3f6bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:29:21 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add GETV_STRETCH43: stretch the 4:3 image to fill the
 window

Psymatic Arcade feeds a 16:9 signal to modulators that squeeze it back
to 4:3, so the native 4:3 frame has to be stretched 4/3 horizontally
with no pillarbox. GETV_STRETCH43=1 gives RATIO_X/RATIO_Y independent
per-axis scales, zeroes the pillarbox offsets, makes
gfx_adjust_x_for_aspect_ratio() the identity, and applies the same
split to the text overlay. It overrides widescreen. Defaults off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
